[statement]
A character device whose magic is GNU's, `ustar` and a space, with the
version `00`, its device fields 5,7. GNU tar and Go read it as a v7 header,
device 0,0; bsdtar and Python read the fields, 5,7. ferrotape refuses it.

[archive]
header name=c typeflag=3 devmajor=5 devminor=7 @257="ustar 00"
header name=a
data "x"
end

[verdict]
all: refused UnknownMagic at 0

